# 行尾约定：避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 把脚本改成 CRLF
#
# install.sh 一旦变成 CRLF，macOS/Linux 用户 `curl ... | sh` 会直接失败：
#   sh: 1: $'\r': command not found
#   /bin/sh^M: bad interpreter: No such file or directory
#
# 源码也统一 LF：esbuild 会把模板字符串里的换行原样打进 client.js，
# Windows 检出成 CRLF 时 bundle 与 Linux CI 不一致，check:client 会失败。

* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
